WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Just put it here

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
It's too late and I won't invite you in.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,040
I really trouble you today

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,040
You can divide this among several of you and use it as a thank you gift.

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,040
No need. Just a favor.

6
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,040
Take it. It’s hard to buy these with cash now.

7
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,040
You even helped me move things in the rain at night

8
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,040
Okay, then I'll thank you on their behalf

9
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,040
go to bed early

10
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:43,380
Are you hungry, grandma?

11
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,380
Go to sleep Go to sleep

12
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,380
Mom will always be with you
